  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ea6fd94ccb08b604482e63f67d8582ae, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LoadingTipsUI
  loadingTip: {fileID: 2253855504024026552}
  loadingTips:
  - Talismans grant small shards of power when equipped.
  - Soulbinds grant great power, but demand more vitality charges in exchange.
  - Vestiges and Remembrances can be drawn from many corners of the world. Access
    your Status to assess and swap them, as well as your Talismans and Soulbinds.
  - You can change the charge buildup trigger for your Remembrance in the Status
    panel.
  - Resting at an Aspect causes all statuses to be restored, but most defeated enemies
    will remanifest.
  - Being Returned will cause you to lose all Fragments. You may retrieve them by
    returning to the location of death, but if you are Returned again before retrieval,
    they will be lost forever.
  - Your strength can be increased by ().
  - Tutorials, item records, and more details can be accessed through the Archive.
